1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Carl Knutsson=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth: December 1600 in Gamla Kopparberg (Falun) Sweden 
2 CONT * Christening:	Jan 1 1601 in Skinnskatteberg, Vastmanlands, Sweden
2 CONT * Rostvändare was a byname, referring to his profession as responsible for the even roasting of the copper ore before smelting.
2 CONT * Carl Rostvändare died on New Year's Day 1692. He was born at Gamla Kopparberg (Falun) in December 1600 and baptized on New Year's Day 1601. He married when he was 32. He lived in harmony with his wife for 59 years and had three 
2 CONC sons and two daughters, one son is dead. He has been in this parish for 29 years.
2 CONT *  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000010566927539&photo_id=6000000134370198902&position=0 '''Death Record:'''	January 03,1692 in Skinnskatteberg, Vmanlds, Sweden.] 
2 CONT * Burial:	Jan 10 1692 in Skinnskatteberg, Vmanlds, Sweden
2 CONT * Born: December 1600, Falun, Married Malin Larsdotter 1633 Died: 1/1 1692 (Skinnskatteberg C:2 (1678-1698) p. 289) Blessed Carl Rostvändare, born at Gamla Kopparberget 1600, christened on New Year's Day 1601, married at the age o
2 CONC f 32, had 3 sons 2 daughters, one of the sons died. Lived in the parish 29 years, died 1 January 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Malin Larsdotter''' in 1633 in Falun, Dalarna, Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT We find Carl Knutsson Rostvändare in the first household record for Skinnskatteberg (started in 1663) as head of a household in Mellan-Uggelfors. His wife, Malin Larsdotter is there, as are sons Knut, Lars and Peder. There is also
2 CONC  a note about his death in 1692.[1] Carl Rostvändare is also (ater in Övre Uggelfors in the same record, now with daughters Anna and Kerstin.[2] In the taxation record Carl Knutsson Rostvändare is listed at Koppargruvan. The first
2 CONC  time seems to be 1666; this may also be when he was entered in the household record.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Knut Karlsson;''' birth: 24 Sep 1636 in Stora KopparbergW, Sweden, death 16 Oct 1717 in Emthyttan,Skinnskatteberg, Västmanland, Sweden
2 CONT * '''Lars Karlsson;''' birth, abt 1638 in Falun, Kopparberg, Sweden
2 CONT * '''Peder Karlsson;''' birth, abt 1640in Falum, Kopparberg, Sweden
2 CONT * '''Anna Karlsdotter;''' birth abt 1642 in Falun, Kopparberg, Sweden
2 CONT *  '''Kerstin Carlsdotter;''' birth:	circa 1644 in Falun, Kopparberg, Sweden, death:	circa 1689 in Hishult, Halland, Sweden
2 CONT * '''Marita Karlsdotter;''' christening; 28 Jan 1649 in Gavebonabben, Skinnskatteberg, Vmanlds, Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000010566927539&photo_id=6000000134373628842&position=0 '''Carl Knutsson aka Rostvändare & Malin Larsdotter listed in Skinnskatteberg church archive, House interrogat
2 CONC ion lengths,''' SE / ULA / 11336 / AI / 1 (1663), photo id: C0020361_00035]
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id= 6000000134373628842&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000010566318185&photo_id=6000000218644305870&position=0 '''Carl Knutsson aka Rostvändare & Malin Larsdotter listed in Skinnskatteberg church archive, House interrogat
2 CONC ion lengths, SE / ULA / 11336 / AI / 1 (1663), photo id: C0020361_00035''']
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id= 6000000218644305870&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT =Biography=
2 CONT
2 CONT We find Carl Knutsson Rostvändare in the first household record for Skinnskatteberg (1663) as head of household in Mellan-Uggelfors. His wife, Malin Larsdotter is there, as are sons Knut, Lars and Peder. There is also a note about
2 CONC  his death in 1692.[1] Carl Rostvändare is also (later?) in Övre Uggelfors in the same record, now with daughters Anna and Kerstin.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rostvändare was a byname, referring to his profession as responsible for the even roasting of the copper ore before smelting.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl Rostvändare died on New Year's Day 1692. He was born at Gamla Kopparberg (Falun) in December 1600 and baptized on New Year's Day 1601. He married when he was 32. He lived in harmony with his wife for 59 years and had three so
2 CONC ns and two daughters, one son is dead. He has been in this parish for 29 years.[4]
2 CONT
