2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Kauko Uolevi Konttinen''' was born on December 23, 1912 in Leppävirta. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34724049211 Juho Heikki Konttinen] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683445610 Lahja Lyyli Konttinen]. He w
