2 CONC Title=Tyra+Wadner%252C+lottornas+grundare+%2528f%25C3%25B6dd+Nordqvist%2529&lang=EN MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 13 2022, 3:51:36 UTC''
